## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## Inntektsmodell (Income Model) Service Sub-Profile — SKELETON
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## ROLE: Placeholder profile for the income/revenue model (initial
##       scope: Østlandet). Records which NeTEx tariff/fare objects
##       the model relates to. SKELETON only — the real consumes set
##       and SHACL constraints must be filled in once confirmed.
##
## Peer of the other service sub-profiles: imports netex-entur.ttl,
## never another sub-profile. Builds conceptually on the product
## catalogue (netex-entur-produkt.ttl).
##
## Imports: netex-entur.ttl (Entur governance + codespaces)
##          → netex-nordic.ttl → generated NeTEx base (netex:) + nordic vocab
##
## Generated: 2026-08-12
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix netex:   <https://netex-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix profile: <https://netex-cen.eu/profile#> .
@prefix entur:   <https://entur.org/ontology#> .
@prefix inntekt: <https://entur.org/service/inntektsmodell#> .
@prefix sh:      <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

## --- Import Entur governance ---
<https://entur.org/service/inntektsmodell> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://entur.org/ontology> .

## =================================================================
## SERVICE DEFINITION
## =================================================================

inntekt:IncomeModelService a entur:SubProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Inntektsmodell — Income Model Service Profile (skeleton)" ;
    skos:definition "Sub-profile for the income/revenue model. Initial scope: Østlandet. Skeleton — constraints to be confirmed." ;
    entur:basedOn profile:NP ;
    inntekt:initialScope "Østlandet" .

## =================================================================
## OBJECTS IN SCOPE (provisional)
## =================================================================
## Likely NeTEx tariff/fare touchpoints. Confirm against the
## generated base before adding SHACL.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

inntekt:IncomeModelService inntekt:requiresClass
    netex:Tariff ,
    netex:FareStructureElement ,
    netex:DistanceMatrixElement ,
    netex:FareZone .

## PROPOSAL: Fill in inntekt:consumes and add inntekt:IM_{ClassName}Shape
## constraints once the income model is confirmed. Verify the class list
## against the generated NeTEx base, and decide the coupling to the
## product catalogue.

## =================================================================
## END OF INCOME MODEL SERVICE PROFILE (skeleton)
## =================================================================
